f focally yellow and focally white tan breast tissue with stitch marking true margin  That aspect of the specimen is inked black  The specimen is sectioned radially and submitted entirely in I  Labeled  new inferior margin  suture on true margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x  3cm focally white tan and focally yellow breast tissue with stitch marking designated true resection margin  That aspect of the specimen is inked black  The specimen is sentinel radially and submitted entirely in J  Labeled  new deep margin  suture on true margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x  4cm yellow breast tissue with stitch marking the true deep margin  That aspect of the specimen is inked black  The specimen is sectioned radially and submitted entirely in K  Labeled  right axillary content  is an aggregate of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3cm  The specimen is sectioned to reveal sixteen lymph nodes ranging in size from  4 to 1 5cm  The lymph nodes are submitted in cassettes L through P with two lymph nodes each in L through N and five lymph nodes each in cassettes O through P  Resident  STEPHEN LAU  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIANOSIS  BREAST  TUMOR SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA ABOUT  2 CM FROM INFERIOR MARGIN  O R  Resident  HOWARD CHANG  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Suzanne B  Keel  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT NEW SUPERIOR MARGIN  PART C  BREAST  RIGHT NEW MEDIAL MARGIN  PART D  BREAST  RIGHT NEW INFERIOR MARGIN  PART E  BREAST  RIGHT NEW DEEP MARGIN  PART F  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA  , No.
